# Simulator recorders pin this day; the answer is gravy, and the day
# before it, which the archive opens, is dizzy.
wait-for Inkling
expect-missing Shapes, not color
expect-missing Enter guess
tap Rules
expect Black: right spot.
expect Hard mode
expect Guesses can leave out letters found.
clean
shot inkling-help
# Hard mode is a switch on the rules, applied on the tap.
tap Hard mode
expect Each guess must use the letters found.
clean
shot inkling-hard-on
tap Play
# The board stays in view while typing, and a refused word stays typed.
# Where the keys and the board do not fit together, as at the largest text
# size, Type a guess opens the keys on a screen of their own.
maybe-tap-id enter
type abc
tap Guess
expect Use five letters.
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type zzzzz
tap Guess
expect Not in the word list
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type crane
tap Guess
expect 1 of 6
expect-missing Right spot
clean
shot inkling-knowledge
# CRANE found R and A in place, so hard mode refuses a guess that drops them.
maybe-tap-id enter
type stone
tap Guess
expect Hard mode: use every letter you have found
clean
shot inkling-hard-refused
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
maybe-tap-id cancel
# The day's guesses and the switch are saved, so a relaunch keeps both.
restart
wait-for Saved game restored.
clean
shot inkling-restored
tap Rules
expect Each guess must use the letters found.
tap Hard mode
expect Guesses can leave out letters found.
tap Play
tap-id game-more
expect New game
expect-missing Hard mode
tap Statistics
expect Played
expect Best streak
tap Play
maybe-tap-id enter
type rival
tap Guess
expect 2 of 6
maybe-tap-id enter
type gravy
tap Guess
expect Solved
expect Play an earlier day
clean
shot inkling-solved
tap Statistics
expect 100%
clean
shot inkling-stats
# Export writes a file a computer can fetch; a refused write says so and
# carries its retry.
tap Export results
wait-for Saved as export-result.txt
scenario storage-full
tap Export results
wait-for Results could not be saved. Check storage.
expect Try again
clean
shot inkling-export-refused
scenario normal
tap Try again
wait-for Saved as export-result.txt
clean
shot inkling-export-saved
tap Play
# A solved day and its statistics survive a relaunch.
restart
wait-for Solved
expect Play an earlier day
tap Statistics
expect 100%
tap Play
tap Play an earlier day
expect Archive games do not change statistics
expect August 31, 2026
expect Earlier puzzles
clean
shot inkling-archive
tap Earlier puzzles
expect August 26, 2026
expect-missing August 31, 2026
clean
shot inkling-archive-earlier
# Back retraces the earlier page before it leaves the archive.
tap Back
expect August 31, 2026
expect Earlier puzzles
tap August 31, 2026
expect Archive puzzle
clean
shot inkling-archive-day
# Six misses end an archive game with the answer, and leave the daily
# statistics as they were.
maybe-tap-id enter
type crane
tap Guess
maybe-tap-id enter
type stone
tap Guess
maybe-tap-id enter
type rival
tap Guess
maybe-tap-id enter
type mount
tap Guess
maybe-tap-id enter
type plumb
tap Guess
expect 5 of 6
maybe-tap-id enter
type gravy
tap Guess
expect Answer: DIZZY
expect Today's puzzle
clean
shot inkling-archive-lost
tap Statistics
expect 100%
tap Play
tap Today's puzzle
expect Solved
expect Play an earlier day
clean
shot inkling-back-to-today
